Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.19,0:02:18.65,S2,,0,0,0,,{\c&H38382D&\frz309\pos(964,662)}現充
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:24.65,S3,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\blur4\pos(1792,162)}小時候都畫些什麼勒？
